OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service plea after
OL,4,AHalloween calls surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Ambulance Service is
OL,7,Furging people to celebrate safely this
OL,8,FHalloween after a spike in calls last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe ambulance service said it received
OL,12,F3,865 calls for help last Halloween,
OL,13,Frising to 4,144 calls the following
OL,14,Fday. It said a typical day sees about
OL,15,F3,400 calls.
OL,17,FAmbulance bosses linked the rise in
OL,18,Fdemand partly to injuries while
OL,19,Fcelebrating and "increased
OL,20,Falcohol-related incidents".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
