OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service plea after
OL,4,AHalloween calls surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a plea to the public, the service
OL,7,Fhas asked people to take care with
OL,8,Fflammable costumes around candles and
OL,9,Ffireworks, take extra care when driving
OL,10,F- particularly in residential areas,
OL,11,Fand to supervise children.
